<h2>The chronology that decided the application</h2>
<div class="flow">
<div class="fstep"><strong>4 December 2023</strong> — a title suit (T.S. No. 498 of 2023) is filed before the 1st Sub-Judge, Jagdishpur, seeking cancellation of the sale deed at the heart of the dispute.</div>
